Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.07,0:00:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥哥和我 我们需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother and me … we needed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.10,0:00:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却这么走了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You walked away, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.60,0:00:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就这么走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You walked away!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.47,0:00:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸是你说过不要再回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one who said "don't come back, " Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.45,0:00:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你关上了门而不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one who closed that door, not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.26,0:00:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我只是不能接受这个事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, I just couldn't accept the fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.20,0:00:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我 截然不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you and me … we're just different.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.14,0:00:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不再截然不同了 不再会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not different. not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.26,0:00:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,露比 我已经好几个星期没有喝血了 我需要它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby, it's been weeks. I need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.75,0:00:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你跨出底线多远了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you even know how far off the reservation you've gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.52,0:00:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱离正常 脱离人性多远了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far from normal? from human?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.90,0:00:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弟弟正走上一条不归路 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother is headed down a dangerous road, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.63,0:00:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你做得真得是太离谱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's already gone too far, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.98,0:00:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I didn't know you,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.20,0:00:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would want to hunt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.14,0:01:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.09,0:01:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go away! no!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.39,0:01:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.45,0:01:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.21,0:01:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.44,0:01:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊 主啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god. oh, lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.02,0:01:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.08,0:02:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊 上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god. oh, god.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.12,0:02:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 上帝 没事 一切安好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. god. it's okay. it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.84,0:02:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.55,0:02:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.39,0:02:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.44,0:02:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! god!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.06,0:02:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第4季第19集]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.90,0:02:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡得好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.08,0:02:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.70,0:02:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,饿死了 去吃早饭吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm starving. let's get breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.62,0:02:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪吃 两个小时的车程内似乎什么也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where? we're like two hours from anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.13,0:02:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我真是饿得不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm hungry now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.26,0:03:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,后座上还有一个三明治\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's probably a sandwich in the backseat still.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.08,0:03:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,金枪鱼味\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's tuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.64,0:03:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是老爸的手机吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that Dad's phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.33,0:03:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.30,0:03:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是约翰吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, is … is this John?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.38,0:03:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没办法接电话 有什么我能帮你的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't come to the phone. can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.62,0:03:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我得和约翰本人谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no… I really need to talk to John.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.44,0:03:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是亚当·密里根 他认识我\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Adam Milligan. he knows me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.10,0:03:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾告诉你这个坏消息 哥们儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sorry to be the one to break this to you, pal,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.11,0:03:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但约翰2年前就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But John died more than two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.68,0:03:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.12,0:03:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是他儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm his son.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.87,0:04:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,温德姆 明尼苏达州
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.75,0:04:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 听我说 亚当·密里根确有其人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, look, best I can tell, Adam Milligan is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.54,0:04:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,生于1990年9月29日 母亲是凯特·密里根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Born september 29, 1990, to Kate Milligan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.56,0:04:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,出生证明上父亲一栏是空的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No father listed on the birth certificate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.93,0:04:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个鹰级童子军\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's an eagle scout.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.16,0:04:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,高中毕业时满载着各种荣誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Graduated from high school with honors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.58,0:04:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就读于威斯康辛大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}And currently goes to the university of Wisconsin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.44,0:04:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,生物专业 医学预科\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biology major, pre-med.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.05,0:04:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你在听吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean? you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.23,0:04:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对是个陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.74,0:04:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 跟你说了 这小子身份属实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I'm telling you … the kid checks out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.70,0:04:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 所以他是地球上的大活人一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, so he's an actual person on the planet earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.47,0:04:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸的是他被恶魔附了身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sucks he's got a demon in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.63,0:05:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 欢迎光临「奥利佛表哥茶餐厅」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. welcome to cousin oliver's.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.58,0:05:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.21,0:05:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请问 - 我们其实是来等人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I… - we're actually waiting on somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.90,0:05:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.90,0:05:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you …
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.16,0:05:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣水吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy water?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.89,0:05:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 只需来一口耶稣果汁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep … one sip of jesus juice,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.05,0:05:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那该死的恶魔就会痛不欲生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This evil bitch is gonna be in a world of hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.82,0:05:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他没被附身呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what if he's not possessed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.11,0:05:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他就是个变形怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he is a shapeshifter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.63,0:05:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以连银器都备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hence the silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.45,0:05:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之那家伙是要付出代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, either way, this thing is gonna bleed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.91,0:05:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,竟然用老爸做诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, using Dad as bait?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.74,0:05:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他犯得最致命错误 可怜虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the last mistake of its short, pitiful life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.09,0:05:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.32,0:05:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.96,0:05:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.68,0:05:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 老爸的日记上有这么一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen … there's an entry in dad's journal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.99,0:05:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在1990年1月\N{\fnArial\fs30}From january of 1990.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.26,0:05:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面记载他去明尼苏达调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saying he's headed to minnesota to check out a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.41,0:05:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,粗算一下时间 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's, roughly, oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.52,0:05:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,正好是那小子出生前9个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}About nine months before the kid was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.57,0:06:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 巧合罢了 - 巧合吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Coincidence. - coincidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.52,0:06:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来的两页日记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next two pages of the journal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.99,0:06:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,被扯掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Torn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.39,0:06:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是真相信老爸多了个儿子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not actually buying this, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.12,0:06:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着老哥 我也不想相信这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, I don't want to believe it, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.15,0:06:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是说这有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying it's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.88,0:06:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸每次外出都是几个星期之久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Dad would be gone for weeks at a time,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.94,0:06:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他又不是吃素的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he wasn't exactly a monk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.93,0:06:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个猎鬼者孤身来到了小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, a hunter rolls into town,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.73,0:06:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,消灭了怪物 又拯救了美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, kills a monster, saves the girl…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.90,0:06:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时姑娘会以身相许来报君恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes the girl's grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.64,0:06:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你害我开始YY老爸XXOO的场面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now I'm thinking about dad sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.45,0:06:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.36,0:06:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他就只是一次没克制住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he slipped one past the goalie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.60,0:06:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.61,0:06:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adam?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.21,0:06:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.55,0:06:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 这是迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. uh, this is Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.04,0:06:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么认识我老爸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you know my Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.04,0:06:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起工作过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We worked together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.32,0:06:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是怎么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did he die?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.44,0:06:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,因公殉职\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.59,0:07:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是个修理工吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a mechanic, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.66,0:07:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,被车压了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A car fell on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.09,0:07:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚当 你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Adam. How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.60,0:07:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要喝这杯水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'll take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.84,0:07:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是渴死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am very thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.59,0:07:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是老样子吗 亚当\N{\fnArial\fs30}The usual, Adam?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.30,0:07:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 谢谢关心 丹妮斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah. Thanks, Denise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.85,0:07:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最后一次见约翰是什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, when's the last time you saw John?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.29,0:07:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不记得了 几年前吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know. it's…a couple years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.42,0:07:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么现在才打电话给他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you decide to call him now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.98,0:07:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道还能打给谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know who else to call.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.37,0:07:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我仅有的亲人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the only family I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.68,0:07:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom's missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.34,0:07:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 真遗憾 有多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? I'm sorry. uh, for how long?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.60,0:07:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,太悲惨了 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's tragic, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.02,0:07:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你真是约翰的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you're John's kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.75,0:07:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么从来没听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could we've never heard of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.17,0:07:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他和我原先并不知道对方的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause John and me didn't really know each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.44,0:07:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年前才知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not until a few years ago, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.69,0:07:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.61,0:07:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈从未对我提过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom never talked about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.11,0:07:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对他知之甚少\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew some stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.37,0:07:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都知道些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.93,0:08:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈是个护士\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom's a nurse,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.70,0:08:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有次爸爸伤的很重 进了急诊室\N{\fnArial\fs30}And dad came into the E.R. pretty torn up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.39,0:08:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概是由于打猎事故之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunting accident or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.09,0:08:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还知道他的名字 约翰·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I knew his name John Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.99,0:08:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.96,0:08:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能算是个三口家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not exactly a nuclear family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.34,0:08:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 现在谁的家庭又是完整的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, who is these days?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.61,0:08:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你第一次见到他 是在什么时候呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, when did you, uh, when did you finally meet him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.92,0:08:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,12岁的时候吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.96,0:08:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈一直留着他以前的电话号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom had one of his old numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.80,0:08:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直求她 不停地求\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after I begged her … god, 24/7 …
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.49,0:08:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,她才终于打给了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}She finally called him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 约翰一听说我的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, when John heard he had a son,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.88,0:08:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,立马飞奔到这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He raced to town.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.10,0:08:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他放下了所有的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he dropped everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.12,0:08:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,连夜开车赶来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He drove all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.64,0:08:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请慢用 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There you go. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.44,0:08:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来真是窝心啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's heartwarming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.52,0:08:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不介意我吃点东西吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.58,0:08:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 客气啥 吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please … dig in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.86,0:08:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后他大概一年左右来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would swing by once a year or so,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.76,0:08:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,时不时还会打来电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, called when he could.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.55,0:08:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过还是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But still…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.03,0:09:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他教我玩扑克 打台球\N{\fnArial\fs30}He taught me poker and pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.93,0:09:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在我15岁时给我买了第一杯啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And even bought me my first beer when I was 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.14,0:09:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他教我开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}He showed me how to drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.44,0:09:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 他有辆迷人的67年黑羚羊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad … he had this beautiful '67 Impala.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.50,0:09:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞎扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this is crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.47,0:09:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what … you're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.74,0:09:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我没说谎 - 才怪 你就在说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I'm not. - uh, yeah, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.48,0:09:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 但你凭什么说我在说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but who the hell are you to call me a liar?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.63,0:09:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们才是是约翰·温彻斯特的儿子 货真价实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're John Winchester's sons, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.98,0:09:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们才是他的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are his sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.54,0:09:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说我还有哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got brothers?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.73,0:09:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 谁说是你哥哥了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't have brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.80,0:09:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 伙计 我可不管你是不是猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, I don't know if you're a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.67,0:09:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是想玩什么把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what kind of game you're playing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.10,0:09:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没打过猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have never been hunting in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.57,0:09:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便吧 我要走了 我们闪 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever. I'm out of here. Come on, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.26,0:09:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.23,0:09:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他带你去看棒球比赛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took you to a baseball game?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.68,0:09:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我14岁的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, when I turned 14.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.25,0:09:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸陪我过了几个生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad was around for a few of my birthdays.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.90,0:09:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,2004年9月29日\N{\fnArial\fs30}September 29, 2004.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.32,0:09:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一个词 明尼苏达\N{\fnArial\fs30}One word … "Minnesota."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.11,0:10:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真带你去看他娘的棒球比赛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took you to a freakin' baseball game?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.94,0:10:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.01,0:10:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你过生日时老爸带你去干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? what'd Dad do with you on your birthday?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.62,0:10:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚当 你说你打电话给老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adam, you said you called dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.72,0:10:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为你妈失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because your mom was missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.53,0:10:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.58,0:10:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,她失踪多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long has she been gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.85,0:10:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,三天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.85,0:10:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一个见她的人是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was the last person to see her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.28,0:10:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,安比南帝先生 我们的邻居\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Abbinanti, our neighbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.07,0:10:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他周二晚上看到她回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saw her come home tuesday night,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.50,0:10:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她周三就没去上班\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she never showed up to work on wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.65,0:10:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你报警了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you call the police?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.57,0:10:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈医院的上司报了警\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom's supervisor at the hospital did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.18,0:10:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也就尽快赶过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I drove down here as fast as I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.65,0:10:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本应该在这儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have been here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.54,0:10:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 警察是怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd the, uh, what'd the cops say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.18,0:10:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们检查了屋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That they, uh, they searched the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.94,0:10:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没任何发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't find anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.64,0:10:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,她绝不会一声不响就离开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wouldn't leave without telling anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.94,0:11:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就像是人间蒸发了一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like she just dropped off the face of the earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.44,0:11:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.27,0:11:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了床头柜被撞翻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The, uh, nightstand was knocked over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.71,0:11:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was there anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.20,0:11:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.85,0:11:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长说没有外人闯入的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sheriff said there's no sign of a break-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.75,0:11:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你认为警察们遗漏了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you think the cops missed something?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.24,0:11:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.92,0:11:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们眼力可不如我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't have my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.41,0:11:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不就是个修理工吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a mechanic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.18,0:11:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.75,0:11:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 能跟我说些老爸的其他事儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, what else can you tell me about Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.96,0:11:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很了解他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.77,0:11:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但远不及你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not as well as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.71,0:11:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 小鬼 保有点神秘好些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, kid. You don't want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.79,0:12:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.48,0:12:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟警察聊过了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You talk to the cops?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.76,0:12:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 如亚当所说 没任何线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. like Adam said, no leads on his mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.40,0:12:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,意料之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shocker there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.10,0:12:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我找到这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I did find this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.51,0:12:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.50,0:12:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,在1990年 温德姆这儿发生过17起盗墓案\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 1990, there were 17 grave robberies in windom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.05,0:12:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是老爸会来这里的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why dad came through here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.10,0:12:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.00,0:12:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.70,0:12:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 这么说他是来猎捕的 但是什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so he was hunting something. what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.45,0:12:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无头绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.10,0:12:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那几页日记全都被他撕下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those were the pages he tore out of the journal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.25,0:12:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但上个月 盗尸案又再度发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}But last month, the corpse-snatching started up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.50,0:12:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,在本地公墓里有三具尸体被盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three bodies from the local cemetery.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.86,0:12:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管他猎得是什么 都没能斩草除根\N{\fnArial\fs30}So whatever he was after, he didn't kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.29,0:12:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西又回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.50,0:12:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 还更是变本加厉开始爱吃鲜肉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…what … it's stepped up its game to fresh meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.61,0:12:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅是凯特失踪 还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Kate's missing, and, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.30,0:12:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,当地的一名酒保 叫乔·巴顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So is a local bartender … a guy named Joe Barton.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.04,0:12:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈认识乔·巴顿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, does your mom know Joe Barton?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.07,0:12:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不认识吧 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so. why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.19,0:13:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.75,0:13:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.63,0:13:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我把这个床垫移走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a hand with the mattress.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.23,0:13:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次都输\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.95,0:13:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我干嘛就没出布呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't I throw paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.19,0:15:00.76,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欢迎来到Soony Buana Lounge享受欢乐时光）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.22,0:15:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.22,0:15:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚当 冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adam, hey. take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.92,0:15:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别叫我冷静 行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't tell me to take it easy, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.62,0:15:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我家成了犯罪现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}My house is a crime scene,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.09,0:15:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈很可能已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom's probably dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.16,0:15:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你们两\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.12,0:15:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,支我去报了警\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you tell me to call the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.41,0:15:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己却在他们来之前闪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you got to bail before they show?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.39,0:15:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, who are you really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.81,0:15:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察对我妈妈的去向毫无头绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cops didn't know where to look for my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.24,0:15:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你却有本事查清 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, but you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.08,0:15:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,而之前我听到你们提到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I heard you talking earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.36,0:15:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么盗墓者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something about grave robberies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.96,0:15:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们并不是修理工\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not mechanics.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.32,0:15:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想弄明白究竟发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to know what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.13,0:15:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.72,0:15:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是猎鬼者\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.04,0:15:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.52,0:15:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该知道的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}He deserves to know, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.25,0:15:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所谓的猎人是猎什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "hunters"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.35,0:15:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so… basically,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.44,0:16:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,电影里面的那些个怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're saying that every movie monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.37,0:16:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我以前所做的噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every nightmare that I've ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.19,0:16:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实都是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all real?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.78,0:16:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但哥斯拉绝对是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"godzilla's" just a movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.02,0:16:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是猎杀它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hunt them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.69,0:16:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So did Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.60,0:16:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.44,0:16:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 就这么个反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Okay"? That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.52,0:16:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还能说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I supposed to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.66,0:16:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,说我们瞎掰 或是神经病的大有人在\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we're liars, that we're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.36,0:16:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是没人会说 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody just says "okay."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.90,0:16:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可是我的哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.06,0:16:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没必要骗我 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're telling me the truth, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.47,0:16:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然 - 那我相信你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - then I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.52,0:16:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那抓走我妈妈的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What took my mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.71,0:16:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.68,0:16:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前只知道有东西在镇上偷肉体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's in town stealing bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.53,0:16:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且是不论死活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Living and dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.00,0:16:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,置于具体是什么还不得而知\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we don't know what.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.10,0:16:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有很多怪胎都符合这些个特征\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a long list of freaks that fit the bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.92,0:16:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们觉得她还可能活着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think maybe she might still be alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.98,0:16:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能帮些什么吗 - 不必了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How can I help? - you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.14,0:16:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西杀了我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing killed my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.32,0:16:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望能加入你们 手刃它\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're hunting it, I want in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.53,0:16:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没门儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.20,0:16:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 也许 - 也许什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean, look, maybe - maybe what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.91,0:17:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他失去了妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lost his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.02,0:17:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该能够体会他的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we can understand what that feels like.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.75,0:17:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得为什么老爸从没跟我们提起他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think dad never told us about this kid, sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.09,0:17:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,又为什么要撕掉这几页呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think he ripped out the pages?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.72,0:17:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因为 - 因为他想保护他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Because - because he was protecting him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.58,0:17:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸死了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's dead, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.46,0:17:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.47,0:17:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不想让亚当过着跟我们一样的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't want Adam to have our lives, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.01,0:17:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们得尊重他的遗愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're gonna respect his wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.86,0:17:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能插句话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I get a say in this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.86,0:17:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不行 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.61,0:17:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,看好这孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babysit the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.46,0:17:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.23,0:17:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去透个气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.57,0:17:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他都是这样子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he always like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.34,0:17:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎加入我们的大家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.26,0:17:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.98,0:17:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要教你一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna teach you a few things.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.89,0:17:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但迪恩不是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean said.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.14,0:17:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道迪恩说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what Dean said.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.29,0:17:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我更清楚报仇雪恨的滋味\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know what it's like to want revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.68,0:18:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这座坟墓建于1926年\N{\fnArial\fs30}This tomb was built in 1926.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.12,0:18:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,米尔萨普家的四代人都安葬于此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four generations of the Millsap family were interred here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.74,0:18:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以后绝不会这样安葬自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't build mausoleum anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.91,0:18:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那纽金特探员 你好好考虑过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, agent Nugent, have you thought about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.45,0:18:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己以后根归何处了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you might like to spend eternity?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.62,0:18:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的天天都在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the damn time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.10,0:18:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,失踪了三具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, three bodies went missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.21,0:18:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有嫌疑人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any idea who did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.45,0:18:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,流氓吧 而且还是变态又神经的流氓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hooligans … sick, deranged hooligans.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.67,0:18:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是血 是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't blood. what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.33,0:18:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是防腐剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's embalming fluid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.78,0:18:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,盗尸者不但搬走了尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever committed this crime didn't just take the corpses.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.38,0:18:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还将他们开膛破肚\N{\fnArial\fs30}They opened them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.93,0:19:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这儿的警察 头杯啤酒都免费\N{\fnArial\fs30}First beer's on the house for cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.06,0:19:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦警探也不例外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feds, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.13,0:19:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这么容易被认出来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I that obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.54,0:19:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,本地的警察我都认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know all the local badges,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.37,0:19:14.53,Title,0,0,0,0,,但你有《法律与秩序》里那种探员的气质\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you've got that "law & order" vibe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.71,0:19:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦调查局来温德姆调查什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's the fbi doing in windom?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.49,0:19:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在调查乔·巴顿的失踪案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking into the disappearance of Joe Barton.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.00,0:19:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你认识他啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume you knew him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.12,0:19:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.98,0:19:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是他的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm his wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.51,0:19:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫丽莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.40,0:19:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽莎 能跟我说下他失踪的事情吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Lisa, what can you tell me about his disappearance?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.60,0:19:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,该讲的我都跟警长说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same thing I told the sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.20,0:19:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他上周五晚上一直在店里盘货\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stayed late friday before last to do inventory.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.20,0:19:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就再也没回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never came home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.75,0:19:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the police?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.88,0:19:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.05,0:19:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 我很担心他们会放弃找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truth is, I was scared they stopped looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.11,0:19:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.92,0:19:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔也是警察吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe was a cop?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.10,0:19:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是副警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deputy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.75,0:20:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过在任时间不长\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.81,0:20:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是很久以前的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.92,0:20:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在职期间有参与调查过 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't happen to work the, uh, the … the …
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.93,0:20:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,90年代的盗墓案吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The grave-robbery case back in '90?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.96,0:20:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有参与\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did. yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.05,0:20:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是乔找到那些尸体的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe was the one who found those bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.70,0:20:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,还因此获得了嘉奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got an award for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.80,0:20:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可是件有趣的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was an interesting case.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.59,0:20:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,数名失踪者的尸体已找到\N17具尸体在荒废已久的屋中找到
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.17,0:20:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟你说过他是怎么找到的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ever tell you how he did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.03,0:20:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部分时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.14,0:20:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他都会自夸全靠自己警察的自觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said good, solid police work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.18,0:20:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在醉醺醺的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}But after a few beers,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.11,0:20:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他又会承认是因为有人帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd admit he had a little help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.45,0:20:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}From who?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.45,0:20:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个专家 他是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A "specialist" … that's all he'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.06,0:20:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察有抓到那个偷尸体的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cops ever find the guy that stole the bodies?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.23,0:20:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.60,0:20:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我问起乔时\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when I asked joe about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.07,0:20:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总说别再担心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd say not to worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.26,0:20:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都办妥了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That "we took care of what done it."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.04,0:20:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.71,0:20:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸到底是怎么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did dad really die?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.67,0:21:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,被恶魔杀死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.10,0:21:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你杀了那恶魔没\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hunted it down?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.69,0:21:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,替老爸报仇雪恨了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.11,0:21:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩亲手结果了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean killed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.75,0:21:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么算是结束了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's over for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.73,0:21:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事永无止境\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's never over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.11,0:21:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the …
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.60,0:21:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,呆在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.08,0:21:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,在通风口里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in the vents.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.33,0:21:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.90,0:21:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.80,0:22:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的车呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your car?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.90,0:22:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,停在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.69,0:22:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 钥匙拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.48,0:22:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.75,0:22:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.26,0:22:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 快帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.99,0:23:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打中那东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I winged it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.26,0:23:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看清是什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.66,0:23:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本无暇看清\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't get a good look.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.40,0:23:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是什么鬼东西啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.29,0:23:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去追吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should we go after it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.70,0:23:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.94,0:23:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那迷宫样地方 恐怕早跑得无影无踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In that maze? that thing's long gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.84,0:23:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 虽然还不清楚那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so, we don't know what it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.11,0:23:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但至少知道了他的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we do know who it's going after.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.41,0:23:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,先是乔·巴顿 亚当的妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe Barton, Adam's mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.39,0:23:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着就是亚当了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.91,0:23:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,专门躲在车底 守株待兔\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was under his truck, just waiting for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.74,0:23:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我竟直直地走入了它设下的陷阱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It set a trap, and I walked right into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.32,0:23:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别介怀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.11,0:23:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你分析地没错 这是有针对性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right, there's a pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.46,0:23:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔·巴顿曾是个警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe Barton was a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.90,0:23:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很肯定他帮过老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty sure he helped out Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.52,0:23:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前我们找到他 老爸的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we've got him, Dad's girl…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.49,0:23:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有他的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his son.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.36,0:23:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,全是老爸在这儿的旧识\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the people Dad knew in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.86,0:23:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我们知道了它回来的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least we know why it's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.29,0:23:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是来复仇的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wants revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.94,0:24:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去收拾你的东西 我们得赶紧离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab your stuff. we'll hit the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.25,0:24:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不该就这么离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shouldn't leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.50,0:24:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 呆在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, let's stay here,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.33,0:24:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,呆在老爸和小鬼她妈调情的房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the kid's mom got ganked.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.75,0:24:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.43,0:24:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.16,0:24:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 萨姆 我们得先带这孩子离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Sam, we're gonna take the kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.81,0:24:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他交给鲍比后\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna drop him off at Bobby's,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.94,0:24:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你再回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you and me are gonna come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.45,0:24:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,解决老爸结下的梁子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And finish what dad started.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.12,0:24:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,要怎么解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.10,0:24:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没线索 没证人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got no leads, no witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.19,0:24:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一有的就是那东西的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do have what this thing wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.29,0:24:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让那孩子作诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to use the kid as bait?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.19,0:24:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以才一直坚持要他留下是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you want to stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.29,0:24:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许那东西还会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe this thing will come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.65,0:24:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以教教亚当 让他有所准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could train Adam … get him ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.09,0:24:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他随时会送命的 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could die, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.22,0:24:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也随时会没命 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could all die, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.66,0:24:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我们这次能杀了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if we do kill this thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.90,0:24:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要找爸爸和我们报仇的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are tons of other freaks that want revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.93,0:24:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,还会层出不穷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}On dad, on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.56,0:24:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果再找上了那孩子 他还是毫无准备怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if they find the kid instead and he's not ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.90,0:24:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.83,0:24:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意学 不管付出何种代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it takes, I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.69,0:25:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想学\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.48,0:25:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,私人财产禁止进入\N违者将依照明尼苏达州的刑法接受严厉制裁
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.51,0:25:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,很容易的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.07,0:25:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要将后作力和开枪的时机配合好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just feel the recoil and time the trigger pulls.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.92,0:25:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来开三枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three taps.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.30,0:25:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,真得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.32,0:25:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,来试试吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.75,0:25:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来新手运气真挺好 是不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beginner's luck, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.43,0:25:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 老弟 你很有天赋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, man. you're a natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.46,0:25:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,射得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good shooting.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.49,0:25:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢夸奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.58,0:25:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱之犬
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.89,0:25:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,怨灵
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.17,0:25:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 之后我们用火烧了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, then we lit it on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.80,0:25:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是用自制的喷火器吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a homemade flamethrower?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.58,0:25:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 很容易做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. they're easy to build.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.73,0:25:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会教你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.95,0:25:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真得很在行啊 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is some job you got, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.07,0:25:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,当猎鬼者可不是工作 亚当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being a hunter isn't a job, Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.86,0:25:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.28,0:26:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是医学院预科生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're pre-med.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.80,0:26:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定有女朋友和朋友对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a girlfriend, friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.07,0:26:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后不会再有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.27,0:26:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你真打算踏出这一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're really gonna do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.32,0:26:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就必须抛下所有的牵绊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't have those kinds of connections.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.22,0:26:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远地抛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.82,0:26:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们只会是你的软肋\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.05,0:26:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你也只会将他们置于险境中\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll just put those people in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.58,0:26:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他们带去杀身之祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get them killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.68,0:26:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我们必须牺牲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the price we pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.80,0:26:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,而一旦抛下 就再没回头路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cut them out, and you don't look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.92,0:26:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后你唯一可以信任依靠的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one thing you can count on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.37,0:26:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就只有家人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.98,0:26:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.63,0:26:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来聊几句\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I talk to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.59,0:26:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的你到底在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.39,0:26:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.46,0:26:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那句 猎鬼就是生活 你必须抛下一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hunting is life. you can't have connections."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.87,0:26:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不正是老爸曾对你说的话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad gave you that exact same speech, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.42,0:26:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在你离开我们去斯坦福之前说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just before you ditched us for Stanford.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.12,0:26:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾那么厌烦老爸说得那些话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hated Dad for saying that stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.54,0:26:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,而如今你却原封不动地引述给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you're quoting him?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.38,0:26:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我只是意识到老爸是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well… turns out Dad was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.18,0:26:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,几时的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.21,0:26:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直以来都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since always.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.07,0:27:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 看到亚当时 知道我在想什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, when I look at Adam, you know what I see?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.15,0:27:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个正常长大的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A normal kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.05,0:27:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是美味的肥肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.16,0:27:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为在那些恶魔和怪物眼中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because to the demons and monsters out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.89,0:27:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是块美味的肥肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.23,0:27:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经我一度很恨老爸 很恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hated Dad for a long time. I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.52,0:27:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如今我想通了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now I think I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.39,0:27:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我们不曾过过一天正常人的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we didn't have a dog and a white picket fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.17,0:27:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎样 至少老爸为了我们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what? Dad did right by us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.04,0:27:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少他让我们有了自保的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}He taught us how to protect ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.63,0:27:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚当也应掌握同样的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adam deserves the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.78,0:27:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得这是什么话 老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to yourself, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.21,0:27:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说错了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.51,0:27:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我们是没得选了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's too late for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.36,0:27:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们的生活 我们的人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our life. this is who we are, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.79,0:27:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么可抱怨的 我完全接受了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's fine. I accept that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.82,0:27:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但对于亚当而言\N{\fnArial\fs30}But with Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.53,0:27:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还有得选 老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still got a chance, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.61,0:27:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还有机会去上学 有机会成为一名医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can go to school. he could be a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.17,0:27:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么亚当就可以选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes Adam so special?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.35,0:27:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干嘛 你是在嫉妒这孩子吗 - 你不吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What, are you jealous of the kid? - are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.40,0:27:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.13,0:27:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.09,0:27:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not real.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.77,0:27:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚当所了解的那个老爸 不是真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Dad Adam knew … he wasn't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.49,0:27:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些隐藏在黑暗深处的东西 才是真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The things out there in the shadows … they are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.39,0:27:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个世界岌岌可危 那才是真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world is coming to an end. that's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.06,0:27:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,说什么度过美好的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything else is just part of the crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.25,0:27:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本就是阿Q式地自欺欺人\N{\fnArial\fs30}People tell themselves to get through the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.87,0:28:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸没给我们选择的机会 就算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad didn't have a choice with us, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.97,0:28:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但亚当 他有选择的权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}But with Adam, he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.22,0:28:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚当不必承受这份诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adam doesn't have to be cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.58,0:28:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也是温切斯特家的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.24,0:28:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然已经遭受诅咒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's already cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.78,0:28:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.24,0:28:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不管猎捕亚当的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, whatever's hunting Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.31,0:28:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会查个水落石出\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.16,0:28:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经查了个底朝天了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You already looked everywhere, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.48,0:28:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我就再去查一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then I'll look again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.42,0:30:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,家 多温馨的家啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home sweet home.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.58,0:30:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}sloppy Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.11,0:31:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.39,0:31:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,真他妈的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.93,0:31:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.75,0:31:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有进屋的路都封死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've closed off every other way into the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.08,0:31:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一能进来的通道\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this thing's coming,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.37,0:31:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,就只剩这条路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.95,0:32:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.85,0:32:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adam!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.81,0:32:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adam!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.29,0:32:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 - 别去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom? - no.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.57,0:32:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 - 亚当\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom! - Adam!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.21,0:32:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.89,0:32:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚当 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adam, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.75,0:32:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然被抓走了 但我还是逃了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took me, but I got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.44,0:32:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我逃出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.67,0:32:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚当 离她远点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adam, step away from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.20,0:32:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, what the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.15,0:32:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是你妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not your mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.04,0:32:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚当 这是谁 怎么回事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adam, who … what is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.19,0:33:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 离他远点儿 - 这是怎么回事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get away from him! - what is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.20,0:33:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听我的 - 真的是她 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You listen to me. - it's really her, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.83,0:33:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,流了那么多血 你母亲绝不可能活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was too much blood. your mother's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.56,0:33:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,通风口里有那么多血迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was too much blood in the vents!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.02,0:33:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adam!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.89,0:33:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.66,0:33:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他疯了 宝贝 是我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's crazy! Honey, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.71,0:33:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着亚当 真的是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look … Adam! it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.53,0:33:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,它绝不是你妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not your mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.51,0:33:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪 它不是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot it! it's not human!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.20,0:33:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.00,0:34:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,银器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.78,0:34:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪所有测试都不起作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wonder none of the tests worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.57,0:34:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们根本就不是易形者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not shapeshifters.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.14,0:34:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是食尸鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're ghouls.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.62,0:34:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这个词有很强的种族歧视\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I find that term racist.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.30,0:34:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,新鲜人肉 比之前那些好太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fresh meat. so much better than what we're used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.02,0:34:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早该想到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.98,0:34:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是猎杀活人迷惑了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the fresh kills that threw me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.71,0:35:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,食尸鬼通常不会找活人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghouls don't usually go after the living.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.54,0:35:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 你们只是下流的食腐动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, you're just filthy scavengers,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.67,0:35:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,以死人为食\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feeding off the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.34,0:35:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,再化身成你们吃下的死者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking the form of the last corpse you choke down.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.61,0:35:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,并吸取了他们的想法和记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And their thoughts. and their memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.33,0:35:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,譬如化身成亚当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Adam, for instance.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.16,0:35:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们吃什么就是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we are what we eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.42,0:35:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是两只怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.03,0:35:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 这个词你倒是经常用\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you use that word a lot, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.51,0:35:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你未必真正了解其涵义\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't think you know what it means.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.06,0:35:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的血 有点儿不太一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}His blood … it tastes different.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.43,0:35:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的父亲就是怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our father was a monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.38,0:35:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭什么这么说 就凭他所吃的东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? because of what he ate?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.14,0:35:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从未伤害过任何人啊 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never hurt anyone, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.08,0:35:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少 没伤过活人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Living, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.28,0:35:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.74,0:35:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他绝不是什么怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was no monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.27,0:35:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是杀他的那个人就绝对是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the thing that killed him was.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.80,0:35:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个叫约翰·温彻斯特的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A monster named John Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.67,0:35:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这够呛的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.98,0:36:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,多亏了你老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks to your daddy,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.74,0:36:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们姐弟俩不得不自力更生\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother and I grew up on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.69,0:36:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们相依为命\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least we had each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.32,0:36:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你和你老哥那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you and your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.56,0:36:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,相濡以沫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inseparable.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.85,0:36:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 想把你们各个击破还真不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, it was very hard to get you on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.90,0:36:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如你所说 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you said, Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.94,0:36:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你唯一能指望的就是家人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing you can count on is family.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.96,0:36:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十年来 我们活得像老鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for 20 years, we lived like rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.17,0:36:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个又一个的坟地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Graveyard after graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.28,0:36:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都是发臭的肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that stinking flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.07,0:36:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然我们想到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.48,0:36:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛不去试点新鲜的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hey, why not move up to fresher game?"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.48,0:36:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,而自然也想到了下手的好地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we knew just where to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.11,0:37:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇 是永无止境 不是吗 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Revenge … it's never over, is it, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.12,0:37:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 就从约翰那警察朋友下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, it was john's cop friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.57,0:37:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就是他的女人 和他的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then his slut, and then his son.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.10,0:37:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着我立马打给了约翰 但\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I called john, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.77,0:37:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他个该死的竟然已经挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The son of a bitch was already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.11,0:37:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以只好让你和迪恩父债子偿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I guess you and dean will have to do instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.02,0:37:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一次半路不会再杀出个迪恩来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean won't interrupt us this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.84,0:37:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以尽情尽兴地享用你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna feed on you nice and slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.33,0:37:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像享用亚当那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like we did with Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.21,0:37:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 顺便告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and, by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.18,0:37:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他确实是你们的小弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He really was your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.07,0:37:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有权知道这个事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.62,0:37:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们咬第一口的时候他还有口气\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was still alive when we took our first bites.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.87,0:37:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可真会尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he was a screamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.45,0:38:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你越是挣扎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, the more you struggle,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.06,0:38:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,血就流得越快\N{\fnArial\fs30}The faster you're gonna bleed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.71,0:38:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以还是好好躺着 放轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you might as well lie back and relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.08,0:38:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 他们是食尸鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, they're ghouls!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.21,0:38:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说得爆头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means head-shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.47,0:39:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.91,0:39:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来 坐起来 坐起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. come on. come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.98,0:39:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on. hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.13,0:39:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.40,0:39:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.11,0:39:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.93,0:39:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.17,0:39:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.26,0:39:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不正是家人该做的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what family's for, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.22,0:39:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,再压一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep pressure on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.77,0:40:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,确定要这么做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure we should do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.96,0:40:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,食尸鬼没捏造那些照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghouls didn't fake those pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.77,0:40:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,更不会捏造老爸的日志\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't fake dad's journal.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.96,0:40:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚当确实是我们的弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adam was our brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.56,0:40:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死得像猎鬼者\N{\fnArial\fs30}He died like a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.44,0:40:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就该有个猎鬼者的葬礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}He deserves to go out like one.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.91,0:40:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们可以让他起死回生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we can bring him back…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.76,0:40:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,找卡西 让他帮个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get ahold of cass, call in a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.63,0:40:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 亚当已经荣登极乐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Adam's in a better place.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.43,0:40:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 我终于明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I finally get.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.25,0:40:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你和老爸会经常斗气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you and Dad butted heads so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.77,0:40:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩简直就是一个模子刻出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two were practically the same person.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.53,0:40:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有多崇拜他 你很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I worshipped the guy, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.57,0:41:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不止在穿衣打扮和行为举止 模仿他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I dressed like him, I acted like him,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.41,0:41:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至还听一样的音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I listen to the same music.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.48,0:41:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你永远都比我更像他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you were more like him than I will ever be.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.77,0:41:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,到现在才明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I see that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.74,0:41:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把这话当是赞美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take that as a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.51,0:41:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take it any way you want.
